hat $A∧B$ is true if both $A$ and $B$ are true.\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,A∧B\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n\nThen, we add a column for $¬(A∧B).$ Remember that the truth values of $¬(A∧B)$ are opposite those of $A∧B.$\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,A∧B\\,$ | $\\,¬(A∧B)\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |"} :step/id #uuid "ab9043b6-86e0-58a1-93e8-67e6dae7f9ec"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186419030 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186410107 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "49aac272-50b1-592b-864f-1a27db474750" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "¬(P∨Q)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186410069} {:answer/id #uuid "7f9aec45-b986-56ea-b358-ed7dc5a0050d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "P∧Q" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186410078} {:answer/id #uuid "80e5b503-c1f3-55be-8dcc-bddf5095cdd8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "¬P∨¬Q" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186410079} {:answer/id #uuid "95f97ab8-d3e1-53de-9f6b-81d4359de9e6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "P∨Q" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186410081} {:answer/id #uuid "ec945e37-e9c4-5c98-af1f-ed01f7eca675" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "P∨¬Q" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186410092}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186410081} :answer-field/id #uuid "ad0dfdbd-2a82-546a-8ef0-7ca0d999f989" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186410101}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "d4b4ae83-c202-571a-9f3a-530441a220fc" :question/math-academy-id "q-81359" :question/problem "Simplify the statement $P∨¬(¬Q).$" :question/worked-solution "Two negations in a row cancel each other out. So, we can simplify $¬(¬Q)$ to $Q.$\n\nTherefore, the given statement can be simplified to \n\n$$\nP∨Q.\n$$"} :step/id #uuid "c154e26d-1951-59a3-8a98-2844d71a28d7" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186419026}}] :activity/title "The \"Not\" Connective" :activity/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045464 :db/ident :activity.type/review} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186419025}] [{:activity/course {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186046658} :activity/first-step {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186559915} :activity/id #uuid "4cf2d4b9-fb00-5f84-b57a-a90dd47f48ca" :activity/scope {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048349 :topic/id #uuid "97a8f3f2-67ab-5291-a6e0-b7d19b4541f0" :topic/math-academy-id 2790} :activity/steps [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186559915 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186559838 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "01b410b0-6edf-592e-a0c2-df96c4f1275e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "¬P∧¬Q" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186559019} {:answer/id #uuid "1ac703f8-25cf-5379-a51f-d36c3837b8c6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "¬(P∨Q)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186559077} {:answer/id #uuid "59305c28-a58c-5c70-b6bd-b8f2c73c98fc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "¬P∨Q" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186559248} {:answer/id #uuid "cd78f341-7710-550c-a74e-9a718bae813a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "¬(¬P∧Q)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186559512} {:answer/id #uuid "f04e12cb-b592-5bd5-9f5b-828bec2a7c74" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "¬P∨¬Q" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186559600}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186559600} :answer-field/id #uuid "f6bcc4cc-5b75-5cd8-9b55-f2a484187c8d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186559766}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "9c84d136-aecb-53d5-b6db-0a2d449203b9" :question/math-academy-id "q-81404" :question/problem "$11$ is **not** a prime number, or $15$ is **not** divisible by $5.$\n\nExpress the compound statement above in symbolic form given the following:\n\n- $P:11\\text{ is a prime number}$\n\n- $Q:15\\text{ is divisible by }5$" :question/worked-solution "The sentence\n\n$11$ is **not** a prime number \n\ncan be expressed symbolically as $¬P.$ \n\nThe sentence\n\n$15$ is **not** divisible by $5$ \n\ncan be expressed symbolically as $¬Q.$\n\nTherefore, the sentence\n\n$11$ is **not** a prime number, or $15$ is **not** divisible by $5$\n\ncan be expressed symbolically as $¬P∨¬Q.$"} :step/id #uuid "35924b33-e48f-588b-bac7-605ec71e4cdb" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186559965}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186559938 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186389962 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5e9be014-2aa3-5bd4-a9e1-e0b0398b7b47" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\text{F}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186389964} {:answer/id #uuid "dc4716ca-09b5-5696-90a6-d659160241a1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\text{T}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186389965}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186389965} :answer-field/id #uuid "ad63dd8e-745a-5ee8-ab85-28395d823854" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186389963} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5d4799b7-2ec5-55f3-8e94-7c766e2ab8e9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\text{F}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186389967} {:answer/id #uuid "6202532e-097a-5ed3-9a11-d67cfe7d545c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\text{T}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186389968}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186389968} :answer-field/id #uuid "35de7356-6d60-5915-9454-